  "detail_text": "NOTICE OF INTENT TO AWARD A SOLE SOURCE CONTRACT. THIS IS NOT A REQUEST FOR COMPETITVE PROPOSALS. The Bureau of Indian Affairs (BIA) on behalf of the Bureau of Indian Education (BIE) has entered into a sole source Firm-Fixed Price contract with Sun Valley Supply, LLC, under the authority of FAR 13.106-1(b)(1) sole Source. Quarterly Preventive Maintenance HVAC System at Beclabito Day School. The anticipated delivery is March 24, 2027. No solicitation is available, and no technical questions will be answered regarding this requirement. The NAICS code for this acquisition is 238220. The point of contact for this requirement is Charmaine Williams-James, Contracting Officer, via email at charmaine.williams-james@bie.edu.",
